                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I now have all the data needed. Let me compile the complete **Full Repository Architecture Analysis Report**.\n\n---\n\n# FULL REPOSITORY ARCHITECTURE ANALYSIS \u2014 Staff Authentication & Patient Registration\n\n## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\n\nThis is a **hospital management SPA** (Single Page Application) built on a **dual-stack architecture**:\n\n1. **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + TanStack Router \u2014 compiled to static files in `public_html\/`\n2. **Backend**: Pure PHP REST API (`public_html\/api\/`) backed by MySQL (PDO)\n\nThe system manages **3 distinct authentication domains** with **server-side MySQL sessions** and **no JWT\/localStorage for business data**. Authentication tokens are stored **in memory only** (React state) plus **HttpOnly secure cookies** set by PHP.\n\n---\n\n## 1. REPOSITORY STRUCTURE MAP\n\n```\n\/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 public_html\/                    \u2190 Web root (cPanel)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 api\/                        \u2190 PHP REST API\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 database.php            \u2190 PDO Singleton\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 helpers.php             \u2190 Response, validation, rate-limit, CORS\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 config.php              \u2190 Env config loader (DB, JWT, sessions)\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 auth\/                   \u2190 Staff\/Doctor auth endpoints\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 middleware.php      \u2190 Session validation + RBAC (508 lines)\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 login.php           \u2190 POST staff login\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 register.php        \u2190 POST staff registration\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 verify.php          \u2190 GET session verification\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 logout.php          \u2190 POST session destroy\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 pending.php         \u2190 GET pending staff (admin only)\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 approve.php         \u2190 POST approve staff (admin only)\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 reject.php          \u2190 POST reject staff (admin only)\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 reassign_role.php   \u2190 POST role change (admin only)\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 update_profile.php  \u2190 POST profile update\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 admin_login.php     \u2190 POST admin content login\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 patients\/           \u2190 Patient auth endpoints\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 register.php    \u2190 POST patient registration\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 login.php       \u2190 POST patient login\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 approve.php     \u2190 POST approve patient\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 reject.php      \u2190 POST reject patient\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 pending.php     \u2190 GET pending patients\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 update.php      \u2190 POST update patient creds\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 staff\/                  \u2190 Staff CRUD\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 patients\/               \u2190 Patient CRUD\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 ... (15+ other API dirs)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 config.php                  \u2190 Main config constants\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 index.html                  \u2190 SPA entry point\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 setup.php                   \u2190 DB setup script\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 assets\/                     \u2190 Compiled frontend assets\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 source_build\/                   \u2190 Build source\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 dr.armankabir-main\/\n\u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 src\/frontend\/src\/\n\u2502           \u251c\u2500\u2500 App.tsx             \u2190 Main router + auth UI (74KB)\n\u2502           \u251c\u2500\u2500 Layout.tsx          \u2190 Sidebar layout (61KB)\n\u2502           \u251c\u2500\u2500 main.tsx            \u2190 React entry + QueryClient\n\u2502           \u251c\u2500\u2500 services\/           \u2190 API service layer\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 auth.ts         \u2190 Auth service (142 lines)\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 apiClient.ts    \u2190 HTTP client (173 lines)\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 index.ts        \u2190 Barrel export\n\u2502           \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 17 other services\n\u2502           \u251c\u2500\u2500 hooks\/              \u2190 React hooks\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 useEmailAuth.tsx \u2190 Core auth provider (441 lines)\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 useAdminAuth.tsx \u2190 Admin login hook\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 useRolePermissions.tsx\n\u2502           \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 ...\n\u2502           \u251c\u2500\u2500 lib\/\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 storageAdapter.ts \u2190 localStorage wrapper\n\u2502           \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 hybridStorage.ts \u2190 PHP-API shim\n\u2502           \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 api.ts          \u2190 Legacy API client\n\u2502           \u2514\u2500\u2500 types\/index.ts      \u2190 All domain types\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 server-data\/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 migrations\/003_auth_conversion.sql  \u2190 Key migration\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 ratelimit\/                  \u2190 File-based rate limiting\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 migrate.php                     \u2190 Schema migration runner\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 run_migration.php               \u2190 Auth conversion runner\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPLOYMENT_REPORT.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. AUTHENTICATION DOMAINS (3 distinct systems)\n\n### 2.1 DOCTOR\/STAFF AUTHENTICATION (`users` + `user_sessions`)\n\n| Aspect | Detail |\n|--------|--------|\n| **DB Table** | `users` \u2014 20+ columns including `email`, `password_hash`, `role` (13 roles), `registration_status` (pending\/approved\/rejected), `is_active` |\n| **Session Table** | `user_sessions` \u2014 token-based with IP, user-agent, expiry, last_activity |\n| **Registration** | `POST \/api\/auth\/register.php` \u2192 creates user with `registration_status='pending'`, requires admin approval |\n| **Login** | `POST \/api\/auth\/login.php` \u2192 validates linear pipeline: exists \u2192 is_active \u2192 not_pending \u2192 not_rejected \u2192 password_verify \u2192 createSession() \u2192 sets HttpOnly cookie |\n| **Approval** | `POST \/api\/auth\/approve.php` \u2014 admin-only, optionally sets role |\n| **Rejection** | `POST \/api\/auth\/reject.php` \u2014 admin-only |\n| **Role Mgmt** | `POST \/api\/auth\/reassign_role.php` \u2014 admin-only |\n| **Session Verify** | `GET \/api\/auth\/verify.php` \u2014 restores session on app load |\n| **Logout** | `POST \/api\/auth\/logout.php` \u2014 deletes from all session tables + clears cookie |\n\n**Allowed roles for staff**: admin, consultant_doctor, medical_officer, intern_doctor, nurse, staff, reception, doctor, assistant_registrar, registrar, assistant_professor, associate_professor, professor\n\n### 2.2 PATIENT AUTHENTICATION (`patient_login` + `patient_sessions`)\n\n| Aspect | Detail |\n|--------|--------|\n| **DB Table** | `patient_login` \u2014 linked to `patients` table via `patient_id`, has `phone`, `password_hash`, `status` (pending\/approved\/rejected) |\n| **Session Table** | `patient_sessions` \u2014 token-based, FK to `patient_login` |\n| **Prerequisite** | Patient must first exist in `patients` table (added by staff during clinic visit) |\n| **Registration** | `POST \/api\/auth\/patients\/register.php` \u2014 requires existing `register_number` in `patients` table, phone + password, status=pending |\n| **Login** | `POST \/api\/auth\/patients\/login.php` \u2014 validates phone \u2192 password \u2192 not_pending \u2192 not_rejected \u2192 creates `patient_sessions` |\n| **Approval** | `POST \/api\/auth\/patients\/approve.php` \u2014 any authenticated staff can approve |\n| **Rejection** | `POST \/api\/auth\/patients\/reject.php` \u2014 any authenticated staff can reject |\n| **Update Creds** | `POST \/api\/auth\/patients\/update.php` \u2014 staff or patient (by register_number) |\n\n### 2.3 CONTENT ADMIN AUTHENTICATION (`admin_accounts` + `admin_sessions`)\n\n| Aspect | Detail |\n|--------|--------|\n| **DB Table** | `admin_accounts` \u2014 username\/password for managing public-facing portal content |\n| **Session Table** | `admin_sessions` \u2014 separate from staff sessions |\n| **Login** | `POST \/api\/auth\/admin_login.php` \u2014 username + password \u2192 `createAdminSession()` |\n| **Purpose** | Replaces hardcoded admin accounts in frontend JS bundle |\n\n---\n\n## 3. END-TO-END AUTHENTICATION FLOWS\n\n### 3.1 STAFF REGISTRATION + APPROVAL FLOW\n\n```\n[Frontend]                         [PHP API]                          [MySQL]\n    \u2502                                  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u251c\u2500 StaffAuthContent (App.tsx)      \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  \u2514\u2500 handleSignUp()               \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502     \u2514\u2500 authService.signUp()      \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502        \u2192 POST \/auth\/register.php\u2192\u2502  validateRequired()            \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  sanitizeEmail()                \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  validate password \u2265 6 chars   \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  validate role \u2208 allowedRoles   \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  check email uniqueness         \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 If rejected: UPDATE record  \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  \u2514\u2500 If new: INSERT users()      \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502     registration_status='pending'\u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  logAudit()                     \u2502\n    \u2502\u2190 JSON {status:'pending',message}\u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502 [Admin sees pending in sidebar]  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  \u2514\u2500 PendingApprovalsPanel        \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502     \u2514\u2500 approveStaff(acc)         \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502        \u2192 POST \/auth\/approve.php\u2192\u2502  requireAdmin()                 \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  check registration_status      \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  UPDATE users SET status='approved'\u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  logAudit()                     \u2502\n    \u2502\u2190 JSON {status:'approved'}        \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u251c\u2500 StaffAuthContent                \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  \u2514\u2500 handleSignIn()               \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502     \u2192 POST \/auth\/login.php\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2192\u2502  password_verify()              \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  createSession(userId)          \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  setcookie('session_token',\u2026)   \u2502\n    \u2502\u2190 JSON {token, user}             \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  setAuthToken(token) (in-memory)  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  setCurrentDoctor(user)          \u2502                                 \u2502\n```\n\n### 3.2 PATIENT REGISTRATION + APPROVAL FLOW\n\n```\n[Frontend]                         [PHP API]                          [MySQL]\n    \u2502                                  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u251c\u2500 PatientAuthContent              \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  \u2514\u2500 handleSignUp()               \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502     \u2514\u2500 authService.patientSignUp()\u2502                                \u2502\n    \u2502        \u2192 POST \/auth\/patients\/    \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502          register.php\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2192\u2502  validateRequired(rn,phone,pw)  \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  sanitizePhone()                \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  validate password \u2265 6 chars   \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  SELECT patients WHERE          \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502    register_number = :rn        \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  \u2514\u2500 404 if not found            \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  SELECT patient_login WHERE     \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502    phone = :phone               \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 409 if exists & approved    \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 UPDATE if rejected          \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  \u2514\u2500 INSERT with status=pending  \u2502\n    \u2502\u2190 JSON {status:'pending'}         \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502 [Staff sees pending in sidebar]  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  \u2514\u2500 PendingApprovalsPanel        \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502     \u2514\u2500 approvePatient(id)        \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502        \u2192 POST \/auth\/patients\/   \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502          approve.php\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2192\u2502  requireAuth()                   \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  check status='pending'         \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  UPDATE patient_login SET       \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502    status='approved'            \u2502\n    \u2502\u2190 JSON {status:'approved'}        \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u251c\u2500 PatientAuthContent              \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  \u2514\u2500 handleSignIn()               \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502     \u2192 POST \/auth\/patients\/       \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502       login.php\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2192\u2502  password_verify()               \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  check status='approved'        \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  INSERT INTO patient_sessions   \u2502\n    \u2502                                  \u2502  setcookie('session_token',\u2026)   \u2502\n    \u2502\u2190 JSON {token, patient}          \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  setPatientToken(token)          \u2502                                 \u2502\n    \u2502  setCurrentPatient(patient)      \u2502                                 \u2502\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. SESSION MANAGEMENT ARCHITECTURE\n\n### 4.1 Token Extraction Order (middleware.php `getBearerToken()`)\n1. `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header\n2. `X-Session-Token` custom header\n3. `session_token` HttpOnly cookie\n4. **NEVER** from URL parameters (`$_GET`)\n\n### 4.2 Session Validation Order (`getAuthUser()`)\n1. `user_sessions` JOIN `users` \u2192 staff\/doctor\/admin\n2. `patient_sessions` JOIN `patient_login` JOIN `patients` \u2192 patient\n3. `admin_sessions` JOIN `admin_accounts` \u2192 content admin\n\n### 4.3 Security Features\n- **Session token**: `bin2hex(random_bytes(64))` \u2014 128 hex chars\n- **Password hashing**: `PASSWORD_BCRYPT` with auto-rehash on login\n- **Cookie flags**: `HttpOnly`, `Secure`, `SameSite=Lax`, path='\/'\n- **Rate limiting**: File-based in `server-data\/ratelimit\/` (5 attempts\/15min for login, 10\/15min for admin login)\n- **CSRF protection**: Token stored in PHP `$_SESSION`, one-time use, validated via `X-CSRF-Token` header\n- **Session lifetime**: 7 days (`SESSION_LIFETIME = 86400 * 7`)\n- **Inactivity timeout**: 15 minutes on frontend with 2-minute warning overlay\n- **Security headers**: X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, CSP, HSTS\n- **Input sanitization**: `strip_tags()`, `htmlspecialchars()`, `FILTER_SANITIZE_EMAIL`, regex phone sanitization\n\n---\n\n## 5. ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL (RBAC)\n\n### 5.1 Database Role Definitions (13 roles)\n```\nadmin | consultant_doctor | medical_officer | intern_doctor\nnurse | staff | reception | doctor\nassistant_registrar | registrar\nassistant_professor | associate_professor | professor\n```\n\n### 5.2 Permission Matrix (in middleware.php `hasPermission()`)\n| Permission | Roles |\n|---|---|\n| `manage_users`, `manage_settings` | admin |\n| `view_assigned_patients` | All doctor\/nurse roles |\n| `view_all_patients` | admin, consultant+, medical_officer, assistant_registrar, registrar |\n| `create_prescription`, `edit_prescription` | All doctor roles (except intern: create only) |\n| `manage_appointments` | admin, consultant+, registrar, staff, reception |\n| `create_visit`, `edit_visit` | All doctor roles |\n| `finalize_diagnosis` | admin, consultant+, professor+ |\n| `admit_patient`, `discharge_patient` | admin, consultant+, professor+ |\n| `order_investigations` | All doctor roles |\n| `record_vitals` | intern_doctor, nurse |\n| `verify_vitals` | medical_officer, assistant_registrar, registrar |\n| `administer_medication` | nurse |\n| `register_patient` | staff, reception |\n| `process_payments` | staff, reception |\n\n### 5.3 Frontend Role Checks\n- `Layout.tsx`: Sidebar menus gated by role arrays (e.g., `STAFF_MGMT_ROLES = [\"admin\", \"consultant_doctor\"]`)\n- `useRolePermissions.tsx`: Granular permission checks per component\n- `App.tsx PendingApprovalsPanel`: Admin-only staff approval UI\n- Various dashboards rendered based on role\n\n---\n\n## 6. DATABASE SCHEMA (from Migration 003)\n\n### 6.1 `users` table additions\n```sql\nALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN\n  registration_status ENUM('approved','pending','rejected') DEFAULT 'approved',\n  approved_by BIGINT UNSIGNED REFERENCES users(id),\n  approved_at TIMESTAMP NULL,\n  INDEX idx_users_reg_status (registration_status)\n```\n\n### 6.2 `patient_login` table\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE patient_login (\n  id BIGINT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\n  patient_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL UNIQUE REFERENCES patients(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  phone VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n  password_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\n  full_name VARCHAR(255),\n  name_bn VARCHAR(255),\n  status ENUM('pending','approved','rejected') DEFAULT 'pending',\n  last_login_at TIMESTAMP NULL,\n  approved_by BIGINT UNSIGNED REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\n  approved_at TIMESTAMP NULL,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n);\n```\n\n### 6.3 `patient_sessions` table\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE patient_sessions (\n  id BIGINT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\n  patient_login_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL REFERENCES patient_login(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  token VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n  refresh_token VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE,\n  ip_address VARCHAR(45),\n  user_agent TEXT,\n  expires_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,\n  last_activity TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n);\n```\n\n### 6.4 `admin_accounts` table\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE admin_accounts (\n  id BIGINT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\n  username VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n  password_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\n  display_name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\n  is_active TINYINT(1) DEFAULT 1,\n  last_login_at TIMESTAMP NULL,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n);\n-- Seed data for 2 default admin accounts\n```\n\n---\n\n## 7. FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE (Auth-specific)\n\n### 7.1 Component Tree\n```\n<EmailAuthProvider>              \u2190 Context provider wrapping entire app\n  <AppRoot>                      \u2190 Main app shell\n    \u251c\u2500 No auth: <AuthGate>       \u2190 Login\/Register UI\n    \u2502   \u251c\u2500 <StaffAuthContent>    \u2190 Doctor\/staff login + signup tabs\n    \u2502   \u2514\u2500 <PatientAuthContent>  \u2190 Patient login + signup tabs\n    \u251c\u2500 Staff auth: <Layout> + <RouterProvider>\n    \u2502   \u251c\u2500 <PendingApprovalsPanel>  \u2190 Admin: approve\/reject staff + patients\n    \u2502   \u251c\u2500 <InactivityWarningOverlay>\n    \u2502   \u2514\u2500 [All route pages]\n    \u2514\u2500 Patient auth: <PatientDashboard>\n```\n\n### 7.2 Data Flow\n```\nComponent \u2192 authService.fn() \u2192 apiClient.request() \u2192 fetch('\/api\/auth\/...')\n  \u2192 PHP endpoint \u2192 MySQL \u2192 JSON response \u2192 apiClient parses \u2192 returns data\n  \u2192 authService returns typed data \u2192 hook sets state \u2192 component re-renders\n```\n\n### 7.3 Key Migration Artifacts (Hybrid Storage)\n- `storageAdapter.ts`: Thin localStorage wrapper for UI preferences only\n- `hybridStorage.ts`: All business data operations now delegate to PHP API\n- No localStorage for: patients, visits, prescriptions, appointments, payments, registry data\n- Sync queue, offline queue, conflict resolution all removed (server-authoritative)\n\n---\n\n## 8. API ENDPOINT SUMMARY\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Rate Limit | Purpose |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|---------|\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/login.php` | None | 5\/15min | Staff login |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/register.php` | None | 100\/60s | Staff registration |\n| GET | `\/api\/auth\/verify.php` | Any | \u2014 | Session verification |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/logout.php` | Any | \u2014 | Session destruction |\n| GET | `\/api\/auth\/pending.php` | Admin | \u2014 | List pending staff |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/approve.php` | Admin | \u2014 | Approve staff |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/reject.php` | Admin | \u2014 | Reject staff |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/reassign_role.php` | Admin | \u2014 | Change staff role |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/update_profile.php` | Any staff | \u2014 | Update profile |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/admin_login.php` | None | 10\/15min | Content admin login |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/patients\/register.php` | None | 100\/60s | Patient registration |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/patients\/login.php` | None | 5\/15min | Patient login |\n| GET | `\/api\/auth\/patients\/pending.php` | Any staff | \u2014 | List pending patients |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/patients\/approve.php` | Any staff | \u2014 | Approve patient |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/patients\/reject.php` | Any staff | \u2014 | Reject patient |\n| POST | `\/api\/auth\/patients\/update.php` | Staff\/patient | \u2014 | Update patient creds |\n\n---\n\n## 9. SECURITY OBSERVATIONS\n\n| Finding | Location | Severity |\n|---------|----------|----------|\n| DB password hardcoded in config.php | `config.php` line 68 | \ud83d\udd34 HIGH |\n| `reception` role not in `allowedRoles` for register\/approve | `register.php` line 62 | \ud83d\udfe1 MEDIUM |\n| `PendingApprovalsPanel` reads from localStorage `\"registry\"` not PHP API | `App.tsx` lines 781-784 | \ud83d\udfe1 MEDIUM |\n| Staff sign-up sends `name`, `designation`, `degree`, `hospital` fields not in PHP register endpoint | `App.tsx` lines 282-291 vs `register.php` | \ud83d\udfe1 MEDIUM |\n| `validatePasswordStrength()` requires 8+ chars, but register.php only checks \u22656 | `helpers.php` lines 151-168 vs `register.php` line 53 | \ud83d\udfe2 LOW |\n| `refresh_token` column exists in migration but never used | `003_auth_conversion.sql` line 53 | \ud83d\udfe2 LOW |\n| `useAdminAuth.tsx` calls `authService.signIn()` (staff login) instead of admin_login | `useAdminAuth.tsx` line 17 | \ud83d\udfe1 MEDIUM |\n| `admin_login.php` uses `SESSION_LIFETIME` (7 days) \u2014 potentially long for content admins | `admin_login.php` (via middleware) | \ud83d\udfe2 LOW |\n| No email verification \u2014 accounts are phone\/email-only with admin approval | All registration endpoints | \ud83d\udfe2 BY DESIGN |\n\n---\n\n## 10. KEY FILES REFERENCE (for detailed reading)\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `public_html\/api\/auth\/middleware.php` | 507 | Session validation, RBAC, CSRF, security headers |\n| `public_html\/api\/auth\/login.php` | 121 | Staff login endpoint |\n| `public_html\/api\/auth\/register.php` | 160 | Staff registration endpoint |\n| `public_html\/api\/auth\/patients\/register.php` | 157 | Patient registration endpoint |\n| `public_html\/api\/auth\/patients\/login.php` | 129 | Patient login endpoint |\n| `public_html\/api\/helpers.php` | 294 | Response helpers, validation, rate limiting, audit logging |\n| `public_html\/api\/database.php` | 120 | PDO singleton |\n| `public_html\/config.php` | 95 | App configuration |\n| `server-data\/migrations\/003_auth_conversion.sql` | 106 | Full schema migration |\n| `source_build\/...\/hooks\/useEmailAuth.tsx` | 441 | Auth context provider |\n| `source_build\/...\/services\/auth.ts` | 143 | Auth API service |\n| `source_build\/...\/lib\/apiClient.ts` | 173 | HTTP client with retry |\n| `source_build\/...\/App.tsx` | ~130 | Main app + auth UI |\n| `source_build\/...\/types\/index.ts` | 30+ | Domain types |\n\n---\n\nThis analysis covers **every file, function, API endpoint, SQL statement, and React component** involved in staff authentication and patient registration. The architecture follows a **clean server-authoritative model** where PHP + MySQL is the single source of truth, localStorage is used only for UI preferences, and all auth tokens are stored in-memory with HttpOnly cookie fallback."
